Hello,

with git tree v3.14-rc2 the build failed after mostly is built, make gives :
...
  CHECK   include/linux (392 files)
/home/tfoerste/devel/linux/usr/include/linux/kexec.h:50: userspace cannot reference function or variable defined in the kernel
  CHECK   include/asm (64 files)
  LD      samples/hw_breakpoint/built-in.o
  LD      samples/hidraw/built-in.o
  LD      samples/kfifo/built-in.o
  LD      samples/kdb/built-in.o
  HOSTCC  samples/hidraw/hid-example
  LD      samples/kobject/built-in.o
  LD      samples/rpmsg/built-in.o
  LD      samples/kprobes/built-in.o
  LD      samples/seccomp/built-in.o
  LD      samples/trace_events/built-in.o
  LD      samples/built-in.o
  LINK    vmlinux
./.config: line 1: $'\r': command not found
make: *** [vmlinux] Error 127

Indeed,the config started with a "cr lf" :

00000001────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐^┌─────────────────────┐
│00000000 0D 0A 23 0D 0A 23 20 41 75 74 6F 6D 61 74 69 63 61 6C 6C 79 20 │◆│..#..# Automatically │
│00000015 67 65 6E 65 72 61 74 65 64 20 66 69 6C 65 3B 20 44 4F 20 4E 4F │▒│generated file; DO NO│
│0000002A 54 20 45 44 49 54 2E 0D 0A 23 20 4C 69 6E 75 78 2F 78 38 36 20 │▒│T EDIT...# Linux/x86 │
│

but I'm sure that the .config is the result of "make randconfig" w/o manual interaction.




Here's the whole config:


